A kernel apply reads its config in place: the copy cost a set of vectors and
strings on every custom-kernel call. `mlx_metal_set_max_mb_per_buffer` and
`mlx_metal_command_buffer_count` are the C names of the two calls the mlx
host-overhead patch adds.

